 countries associated to Creative Europe MEDIA. For independent European au
 diovisual production companies\; single applicants or consortia.\nAward: F
 ixed lump sum set by total production budget: EUR 70\,000 (budget up to EU
 R 500\,000) rising through EUR 150\,000\, 300\,000 and 500\,000 to EUR 1 m
 illion (budget over EUR 10 million) and EUR 2 million (budget over EUR 20 
 million). Total call budget EUR 23\,300\,000 (animation 5.8 million\, docu
 mentary 1.9 million\, fiction 15.6 million). No application fee.\nDuration
 : Projects up to 36 months. Two deadlines: 10 February 2027 (40 percent of
  the budget) and 15 September 2027 (60 percent). Call opened 30 September 
 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/por
 tal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-TVONLINE?utm_source
