 up to 90 percent of costs for sales agents coordinating cross-border film 
 releases)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 21 Jan 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nFilms on the Move (CREA-MED
 IA-2027-FILMOVE) supports the cinema and online distribution of non-nation
 al European films across borders\, and encourages subtitling\, dubbing and
  audio description. WHO: the applicant is a European sales agent\, appoint
 ed by the film's producer\, with the right to sell the film in at least 15
  MEDIA countries.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commiss
 ion / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to
  Creative Europe MEDIA. For European sales agents holding rights for at le
 ast 15 MEDIA countries.\nAward: Grant of up to 90 percent of total project
  costs with no fixed request limit\; 70 percent prefinancing. Support pass
 ed on to distributors is capped per territory (for example EUR 150\,000 in
  DE/FR/IT/ES and EUR 60\,000 in AT/BE/NL/PL for films up to EUR 15 million
 \; double for animation and bigger films). Total call budget EUR 23\,500\,
 000. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects of 12 to 24 months. Two deadl
 ines: 21 January 2027 and 15 July 2027. Call opened 30 September 2026.\n\n
